From bd607991d5f45df1d773817dc3046d10331d2d6e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kurtxtb <s0917077331@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 16:27:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(platformindicators): show icons next to every username
 on newer Discord

Discord 348 renders member lists, the DM list, DM/channel headers, profiles
and the You tab through one UsernameWithEffects component whose functions are
anonymous under the React Compiler, so the old name-based patches only hit
UserRow. Patch that component by file path, hide the default mobile status
via Status/Avatar by file path, and keep the old patches as a fallback.
Icons now re-render on presence changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
